# Closed-class words that never stand as a counted noun right after an hour:
# pronouns, adverbs and verb particles ("a las 8 te llamo").  Each word's class
# is quoted from its Wiktionary entry (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/<word>); the
# fetched pages are kept with the audit.  Markup is removed from the quotes.
# mi: Pronoun. "inflection of io (clitic, acc). me"
# ti: Pronoun. "inflection of tu (acc//dat); you"
# lo: Pronoun. "(accusative) him"
# la: Pronoun. "(accusative) her, it"
# ci: Pronoun. "us"
# vi: Pronoun. "second-person personal plural object pronoun: you, to you"
# ne: Adverb. "from there"
# si: Pronoun. "(reflexive pronoun) oneself, himself, herself, itself, themselves"
# gli: Pronoun. "(dative) him, to him; it; to it"
mi
ti
lo
la
ci
vi
ne
si
gli
